 stock, and the post-time family gate (#1131 review)

- stock_sim_held_tests (lib): the burn on a carried column grid equals
  the plain-grid burn column for column; both field arms (plain and
  carried) refuse with ELECTRODE_FIELD_REFUSAL.
- sinker_burn_held: the field engine and the field view refuse a burn
